# Keep text files LF on every platform. The Windows release job checks out
# this repo with autocrlf, and `viam module upload` then fails to match the
# README anchor in meta.json's markdown_link ("section #viam-config not found")
# because the heading it slugifies ends in a carriage return. Bash scripts and
# Makefiles are included for the same reason.
*.md       text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.json     text eol=lf
*.toml     text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
Makefile   text eol=lf
